From 9aa1c69a0f53e3d011a6ab9a618edfa8f33f2eda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjoern Bachmann <bjoern.bachmann@emerson.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:47:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hwmon: cros_ec: integrate EC fans with thermal framework

Bind EC fan cooling devices to their device-tree nodes, switch to manual control when applying thermal PWM requests, and restore EC automatic mode during shutdown.

Use board-specific PWM state ranges for the N3xx thermal maps and document the RPM-to-PWM normalization.
---
